      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm preparing a lecture for my Constitutional Law seminar and I want to provide my students with a clear synthesis of the current judicial landscape. Could you provide a detailed summary of the tension between originalist interpretations and living constitutionalist interpretations specifically as they apply to the Second Amendment?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
